# 📌 Key Analytics

## 💰 Sales Performance

The dashboard analyzes:

* Total Revenue
* Average Revenue
* Order Count
* Category Performance
* Sales Distribution

---

## 📦 Product Analysis

Product-level analysis includes:

* Category-wise Sales
* Sub-Category Sales
* Product Performance
* Revenue Contribution

---

## 🌍 Geographic Analysis

Regional and market-level analysis includes:

* Region-wise Revenue
* Market-wise Sales
* Geographic Performance
* Revenue Contribution

---

## 📅 Time-Series Analysis

Yearly analysis helps identify:

* Sales Growth
* Yearly Revenue Trends
* High-performing Years
* Changes in sales performance over time

---

# 📈 Statistical Analysis

The project also includes fundamental descriptive statistics:

| Statistical Measure | Purpose                         |
| ------------------- | ------------------------------- |
| **Mean**            | Average sales value             |
| **Median**          | Central value of sales          |
| **Mode**            | Most frequently occurring value |
| **Variance**        | Measures sales dispersion       |

