# 🧹 Data Cleaning

Before performing analysis, the dataset was prepared using standard data-cleaning practices.

### Cleaning Process

```text
Raw Dataset
     ↓
Data Validation
     ↓
Missing Value Check
     ↓
Duplicate Check
     ↓
Data Type Validation
     ↓
Date Formatting
     ↓
Numerical Data Validation
     ↓
Standardization
     ↓
Analysis-Ready Dataset
```

### Cleaning Activities

* ✅ Checked missing values
* ✅ Checked duplicate records
* ✅ Verified data types
* ✅ Formatted date columns
* ✅ Validated numerical fields
* ✅ Standardized data
* ✅ Prepared data for Pivot Tables
* ✅ Prepared data for visualization

A dedicated **Data Cleaning Notes** section is included in the Excel workbook.

