# 🎯 Project Objectives

The project was developed with the following objectives:

1. 🧹 Clean and prepare raw sales data.
2. 📊 Perform exploratory data analysis.
3. 💰 Calculate important business KPIs.
4. 📦 Analyze category and sub-category performance.
5. 🌍 Analyze regional and market performance.
6. 📅 Identify yearly sales trends.
7. 📈 Apply descriptive statistical techniques.
8. 📌 Create Pivot Tables and Pivot Charts.
9. 🎨 Build a professional Excel dashboard.
10. 💡 Convert raw data into actionable business insights.

