# 🚀 How to Use This Project

### 1️⃣ Clone the Repository

```bash
git clone https://github.com/SumanthBandla/Skill-Nexis.git
```

### 2️⃣ Open the Project

Open:

```text
Global_Superstore_2016_Excel_Dashboard.xlsx
