🧹 Data Cleaning Notes
📊 Descriptive Statistics
📌 Pivot Tables
📈 Analysis Sheets
🎨 Sales Performance Dashboard
```

### 4️⃣ Explore the Dashboard

Review the KPI cards, charts, trends, regional performance, category performance, and market analysis.

